0..78 Comment "// The buffer a read fills is moved into its submission, not borrowed, because"
79..148 Comment "// the kernel owns it until the operation completes (boats, _Notes on"
149..228 Comment "// io-uring_, 2020), and it is handed back with the completion. The buffer is a"
229..301 Comment "// linear resident, here the end of a forked owner, and moving it into a"
302..359 Comment "// submission is delegation (Honda, Vasconcelos and Kubo,"
360..387 Comment "// doi:10.1007/BFb0053567)."
389..428 Comment "// The ring\'s protocol and its entries."
